      "s": "TechCrunch",
      "t": "TechCrunch Disrupt 2026’s biggest stage features leaders from Amazon, Replit, Tether, with much more to come",
      "d": "The Disrupt Stage is where many of the biggest conversations in technology happen, with a legacy that stretches back for more than a decade.",
